<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Екатерина Мощенская</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: #0b0d15;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 360px;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #1a1a2e;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .prof {
            color: #6a11cb;
            font-weight: bold;
            background: #f0ecff;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 10px 0 15px;
        }
        .quote {
            color: #555;
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 10px 0 20px;
        }
        .stats {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            background: #f5f7ff;
            padding: 15px 10px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .stats div {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .stats span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #1a1a2e;
        }
        .stats small {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #777;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .socials {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .socials span {
            font-size: 28px;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #6a11cb;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 60px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 100%;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #2575fc;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #888;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Екатерина Мощенская</h1>
        <div class="prof">🚀 Веб-разработчик</div>
        <p class="quote">«Код, который вдохновляет»</p>
        <div class="stats">
            <div><span>3</span><small>Года</small></div>
            <div><span>50</span><small>Проектов</small></div>
            <div><span>100%</span><small>Отзывов</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="socials">
            <span>📱</span>
            <span>🐙</span>
            <span>🌐</span>
        </div>
        <button class="btn">✉️ Связаться</button>
        <div class="footer">⚡ Готовый блок для личного бренда</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>